 "document": "12-replay.md",
 "version": 1,
 "operation": "replay",
 "distinguishes": "A replay compares a profile's verdict with a mined transaction's receipt as RP-4 says: ok with the receipt's payer agrees, a refusal one named difference or two turn into ok is explained by them, and anything else disagrees; a replay that reads state, credits an unnamed difference, ignores the payer or replays bytes that are not the chain's fails here.",
 "provenance": "The bytes, hashes and receipt payers are mined fixtures of exp-frames 85ee60d, as in sf-03-model-transaction.json; the parent headers were read from the Hegota testnet's eth_getBlockByNumber on 2026-10-20. Where a case writes a value in by hand, its derivation says so.",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "an expiry frame and self_verify on the testnet's profile agrees, with the sender as payer",
   "profile": "hegota-testnet",
   "fixture": {
    "raw": "",
    "hash": "0x045fb58b1c52183b3869d764ac5deebf697dd835d9cacfe2ef54b8283a24f723",
    "payer": "0xa6b01af7512a08b1f0a7603765b21a53a7d1d7db",
    "parent": {
     "number": 304884,
     "timestamp": 1791364951,
     "gas_limit": 200000000,
     "gas_used": 29532,
     "base_fee": 7
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "verdict": "ok",
    "payer": "0xa6b01af7512a08b1f0a7603765b21a53a7d1d7db",
    "comparison": "agree",
    "differences": [],
    "header": "read"
   },
   "derivation": "Chain 8141 is the profile's; FP-3 to FP-6 pass (max_gas 78441 under the parent's 200000000; prefix 5000 + 20000 + 2800 under 500000); the prefix [expiry_verify, self_verify] pays from the sender, the receipt's payer."
  },
  {
   "name": "the same under the EIP's profile: the testnet's expiry verifier is not the EIP's",
   "profile": "eip-8141",
   "config": {
    "surface": {
     "chain_id": 8141
    }
   },
   "fixture": {
    "raw": "",
    "hash": "0x045fb58b1c52183b3869d764ac5deebf697dd835d9cacfe2ef54b8283a24f723",
    "payer": "0xa6b01af7512a08b1f0a7603765b21a53a7d1d7db",
    "parent": {
     "number": 304884,
     "timestamp": 1791364951,
     "gas_limit": 200000000,
     "gas_used": 29532,
     "base_fee": 7
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "verdict": "ErrFrameUnrecognizedPrefix",
    "comparison": "explained",
    "differences": [
     "expiry_verifier"
    ]
   },
   "derivation": "Under eip-8141 the frame to 0x..8141 is a VERIFY frame with flags 0 that is not expiry_verify, so the prefix is not a recognised shape (FP-5 rule 4). With expiry_verifier set to 0x..8141 it is [expiry_verify, self_verify] and passes."
  },
  {
   "name": "a recent-root frame in the prefix is a named difference on the testnet's profile",
   "profile": "hegota-testnet",
   "fixture": {
    "raw": "",
    "hash": "0x11594d4ddea48ab65af7649c9a0fa5fb95041628c5601380433d7d832d0c987a",
    "payer": "0x56208581d049a396e81f6c3cea6decde79006189",
    "parent": {
     "number": 316317,
     "timestamp": 1791437875,
     "gas_limit": 200000000,
     "gas_used": 97920,
     "base_fee": 7
    }
   },
   "expect": {
    "verdict": "ErrFrameUnrecognizedPrefix",
    "comparison": "explained",
    "differences": [
     "recent-roots"
    ]
   },
   "derivation": "The prefix is [expiry_verify, VERIFY flags 0 to 0x..8272, only_verify, pay]; the second frame has no class, so the shape is not recognised. Without the frames to 0x..8272 it is [expiry_verify, only_verify, pay], a recognised shape, within 500000."
  },
  {
