   "derivation": "RP-6: frames-devnet-0 under eip-8141 with the plain envelope; its RPC no longer answers, so RP-3 leaves out FP-3's gas-limit comparison. The prefix is [self_verify] at 5000 plus 2800, and pays from the sender."
